    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d67a1945dd3afd988018eaf3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们是同一个年级，\n很常会在同一场赛事中互相竞争，\n所以她们也是我的劲敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1e79d4767d965947b62abf9fbd14932327aa1c51989ebb165d6b2986c20e244",
